== Biography

I am a Ph.D. student in the Department of Computer Science and Engineering at [https://www.cuhk.edu.hk/english/index.html The Chinese University of Hong Kong (CUHK)], advised by [http://www.cse.cuhk.edu.hk/~byu/ Prof. Bei Yu]. Prior to that, I received my Bachelor's degree in Electronic Science and Technology from [https://www.zju.edu.cn/english/ Zhejiang University] in 2025.

My research interests include:

- Electronic Design Automation
- Computer Architecture

Feel free to contact me at [lzt_tzl@outlook.com lzt_tzl@outlook.com] if you'd like to chat!


